  "id": "subjects-rights",
  "term": "subjects’ rights",
  "definition": "Subjects’ rights are the protections and entitlements of people who take part in research, especially regarding their privacy and ethical treatment. In this context, the term refers to safeguarding participants when biosamples are shared, reused, or stored.",
